hury College\nJagan Nath Singh College\nMHCM Science College\nNotice\nAISHE\nGallery\nContact Us\nMore\nAdmin Login\nWebmail Login\nPrevious slide\nNext slide\nSARADA CHARAN DEY COLLEGE, KALINAGAR\nWELCOME\nSarada Charan Dey College, Kalinagar is an institution of Higher Education established in the year 1992 by a general meeting held on 13.09.1992 in Annada Charan Girl’s High school , Kalinagar by the initiative of local people including social workers, academicians and the representatives of people .In this meeting after a threadbare discussion unanimously resolved to establish a college in this locality to cater to the growing needs of Higher education from the current academic session 1992 and the college be named after the name of late Sarada Charan Dey, a veteran social worker and patron of learning to commemorate his sweet memory. Sarada Charan Dey College, Kalinagar is a rural Higher Educational institution situated in the district of Hailakandi of Assam, which is affiliated to Assam University, Silchar.\nThe college started its journey in the year 1992 by some local active and generous people with some noble vision and mission. The college initially started in its own land in a bamboo platted classrooms. After two/three years an R.C.C. building was constructed with the donation received from local M.L.A. The college obtained permission to start classes under Guwahati University in the year 1993. Then in the year 1995 after the inception of Assam University Silchar, the institution came under Assam University as an affiliated College. Since then, joint effort has been taken and trying its level best for satisfactory academic performance besides excelling in various fields including games and sports and cultural activities. In the year 2019 the college received financial aid from Rs. 50 Lakhs from State Govt. for the first time. Due to newly constructed building, proposed three storey building the office of the college has been shifted which is above the flood level. Regarding Digital classroom, Digital Library, the work is in progress and expecting to be completed within a short period of time.\nLearn More About Us\nMrs. Shampa deb kanungo\nPRINCIPAL\nWith the passage of time Sarada Charan Dey College has stepped into 31st year of its existence. This journey has not at all been very smooth; rather many odds had to be overcome to achieve the present position. During this period, the college has been able to get in touch with many learned faculty members and gather a lot from their knowledge and experience.\nLearn More About Us\nRECENT POST\n3RD/5TH SEM ADMISSION\nFOR FYUG AND TDC CBCS\nADMISSION\nAdmission Closed\nonline admission portal\nADMISSION FOR ARTS & COMMERCE\nCONTINUE TO ADMISSION\nClick Here\nCLICK HERE FOR MORE NOTICE\nHOLIDAY ON 2nd October 2026\nClick here\nADMISSION notice 4th Year\nClick here\n2nd-Internal-2026-odd Sem.\nClick here\nHoliday on 18th Sept.,2026\nClick here\nNOTICE (SEVA KANKALP ABHIYAN)\nClick here\nInternal Assessment Schedule\nClick here\nInternal Assessment Notice\nClick here\nNOTICE (Disciplinary Rules)\nClick here\nHoliday on 4th Sept.2026\nClick here\nClick here for More\nLATEST EVENTS\nPrevious slide\nNext slide\nMore Events\nPHOTO GALLERY\nPrevious slide\nNext slide\nMore photos\nScan the QR to visit College Website\nIMPORTANT LINKS\nAssam University\nDirector of Higher Education\nRUSA\nNAAC\nAISHE\nUGC\nNVSP: Voter registration\nMy Gov\nContact Info\nSarada Charan Dey College\nAddress:\nKalinagar, Hailakandi, National Highway 37, Assam 788801\nPhone:\n+91-60021 00695\nEmail:\nscdeycollege@gmail.com\nOpens in your application\nFollow Us\nOur Visitor\nDesigned & Developed By: F.S.Enterprise Mobile:8638640830\n© Copyright:2024-\nSarada Charan Dey College", "links": [{"label": "Skip to content", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/#main"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in"}, {"label": "Home", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/"}, {"label": "About", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/"}, {"label":